GPUPAL's preferred citation is pending maintainer approval before v0.1.0.
Until named authors and any DOI are confirmed, cite the exact GPUPAL commit and
repository URL:

  GPUPAL contributors (2026). GPUPAL: GPU Pointcloud Abstraction Library.
  https://github.com/zymazza/GPUPAL, commit <full commit SHA>.

GPUPAL is derived from and retains the upstream PDAL implementation. When your
work relies on PDAL itself, also use PDAL's official citation:

  PDAL contributors (2026). PDAL: The Point Data Abstraction Library.
  https://pdal.org/. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10884408
